-------------- General Files --------------
   cd = change directory
    / = go to previous (parent) directory
   .. = go to previous (parent) directory
    : = go to top of files
    d = download (ie. "d bells.lzh")
    u = upload   (ie. "u bells.lzh")
    i = info about file (ie. "i bells.lzh")
  dir = show current directory (names)
 list = show files with sizes and dates
 main = go back to main menu
 quit = exit from bbs (also bye or logout)
-------------------------------------------
